# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum subspace diagonalization tools {#quantum-subspace-diagonalization-tools}"
msgstr "Alat diagonalisasi subruang kuantum {#quantum-subspace-diagonalization-tools}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These tools provide capabilities for building workflows to estimate the eigenvalues of quantum Hamiltonians, like the ground state energy of a molecule, using approaches such as sample-based quantum diagonalization that can scale beyond exact classical diagonalization methods. These workflows use a quantum circuit to sample candidate configurations, then iteratively refine the configurations and diagonalize the system’s Hamiltonian in the reduced subspace spanned by those configurations.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"Alat-alat ini menyediakan kemampuan untuk membangun alur kerja yang mengestimasi nilai eigen Hamiltonian kuantum, seperti energi ground state sebuah molekul, menggunakan pendekatan seperti sample-based quantum diagonalization yang bisa melampaui skala metode diagonalisasi klasik eksak. Alur kerja ini memakai Circuit kuantum untuk mengambil sampel konfigurasi kandidat, lalu menyempurnakan konfigurasi tersebut secara iteratif dan mendiagonalisasi Hamiltonian sistem dalam subruang tereduksi yang direntang oleh konfigurasi-konfigurasi itu.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimate the spectrum of quantum Hamiltonians by processing noisy samples and diagonalizing in a reduced subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimasi spektrum Hamiltonian kuantum dengan memproses sampel yang berisik dan mendiagonalisasi dalam subruang tereduksi.\"\n"
"      href=\"/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Jelajahi dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"

